# Agent gate ledgers and hook state are machine-local. The unlazy skill writes
# `.claude/settings.local.json` containing absolute paths to this machine's node
# and to the vendored skill, and its Stop-hook state is per session. Committing
# either would publish local layout and machine-specific paths. The skill's own
# SECURITY.md asks consumers to keep all three untracked, so enforce it here
# rather than relying on a local exclude file that is not shared.
/.unlazy/
/.unlazy-hook-state.json
/.claude/settings.local.json
